      "content": "I believe systemic racism in housing and banking is a critical issue that needs to be addressed head-on. The housing sector has historically discriminated against people of color through redlining, restrictive covenants, and unequal lending practices. Banks have also played a role by denying loans and charging higher interest rates to minority communities. It's essential to teach students about these injustices to foster awareness and advocate for change. By understanding these systemic issues, students can become informed citizens who work towards a more equitable society.",
